          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-the-goutweed:1ykne3l",
          "html": "<i>Search</i> the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cooking_pot_(Death_Plateau)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cooking pot</a> to obtain a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Goutweedy_lump\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">goutweedy lump</a>.",
